OL,3,AMen charged over alleged plot to target
OL,4,AManchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood said
OL,7,Fnews that two Iranian men had been
OL,8,Fcharged over the alleged plot would be
OL,9,F"deeply distressing" to Manchester's
OL,10,FJewish community, as the city marks one
OL,11,Fyear since the Heaton Park Synagogue
OL,12,Fattack.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
