OL,3,ATories pledge to build 50,000 new
OL,4,Aprison places
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have promised to
OL,7,Fbuild 50,000 new prison places in
OL,8,FEngland and Wales to stop criminals
OL,9,Fbeing released early, if they return to
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FThe party said it would cost #2bn per
OL,13,Fyear to build and run the new prisons,
OL,14,Ffunded by spending cuts including to
OL,15,Fthe foreign aid budget.
OL,17,FOn Thursday hundreds of prisoners were
OL,18,Freleased early, under new rules
OL,19,Fintroduced to prevent jails reaching
OL,20,Fcapacity, with around 4,500 due to be
OL,21,Ffreed by next summer.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
