OL,3,ATories pledge to build 50,000 new
OL,4,Aprison places
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour blamed the previous Tory
OL,7,Fgovernment for leaving "our criminal
OL,8,Fjustice system at breaking point" and
OL,9,Fsaid the party's proposals were not
OL,10,F"credible".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
