OL,3,AUS murderer Christa Pike unconscious
OL,4,Aand on ventilator after failed
OL,5,Aexecution, lawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Fthat readers may find distressing
OL,10,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,11,Fwas unconscious, intubated and on a
OL,12,Fventilator on Thursday night, after
OL,13,Fauthorities failed to execute her by
OL,14,Flethal injection, her lawyers say in
OL,15,Fcourt filings.
OL,17,FPike, 50, was injected with two lethal
OL,18,Fdoses of pentobarbital on Wednesday but
OL,19,Fremained alive. She was then sent to
OL,20,Fhospital in an ambulance.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
